WEBVTT

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.780
In any case, it's inconceivable.

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:08.730
To think that I, Shikyouin Hibiki,

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:12.270
should be unacknowledged by Super Cyalume Coord.

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:16.080
It's an unpleasant astronomical unlikelihood, but so be it.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.480
I suppose I'll have to forgive your not perceiving my true ability...

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:22.110
seeing it only once – you are only an infant, after all.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.220
I'll put aside any lingering ill will and obtain a Super Cyalume Coord as soon as...

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.010
Without sacrifice, the wheels of revolution...

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:34.680
Unhand me!

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.400
Capisce!

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.130
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.220
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:46.430
Keep winning through the Divine Idol Grand Prix and become a Divine Idol!

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:49.020
All the other idols are amazing, but I won't give up!

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.020
Cheer me on, everyone!

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.890
What a repulsive creature you are.

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:31.000
Are you incapable of even listening to others?

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:37.080
I refuse to acknowledge such a being as a goddess!

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.970
Please don't be mad at her, Hibiki-san.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:42.910
She's not doing it deliberate-pri.

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:45.280
You can be pretty childish, huh, Maho-chan?

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:48.490
That's enough out of you – and this entire farce.

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:51.650
I'll simply show her a true idol's performance.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.680
Look well with those <i>innocent</i> eyes,

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:56.040
defective little goddess.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:01.490
Oh my god, Hibiki-sama!

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.700
Hey there. I guess I've kept you waiting.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.580
Parajuku mesdemoiselles.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.790
We shall make this evening a night to remember.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.410
Mm! You're so <i>cool</i>, Hibiki-sama!

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:13.250
Hibiki-sama, amore!

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:16.260
Oblation to the pure maidens gathered this hallowed night.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:51.850
Making Drama, switch on!

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:54.580
Onward!

00:04:58.620 --> 00:04:59.920
I will uphold it!

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:01.790
Sapphire revolution!

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:03.470
Pristine rhapsody!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:09.370
The wheels of revolution will not turn without sacrifice!

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:14.210
Airy Change!

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:20.940
Gold Airy!

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:55.090
I love you! I adore you! Oh, Hibiki-sama!

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:57.780
Oh, god, Hibiki-sama, I love you!

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.140
<i>What are you waiting for?</i>

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:05.600
<i>Why haven't you bestowed the Super Cyalume Coord?</i>

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:09.510
<i>Don't tell me that good-for-nothing goddess fell asleep?</i>

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:13.810
<i>She's watching properly?</i>

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:15.090
<i>Then why...?</i>

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:19.840
I demand to see your parents!

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:21.170
Hello there.

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:22.900
You've raised an ignoramus!

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:23.870
Maho-chan,

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:25.390
whoa there, girl, whoa there.

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:26.300
Falulu...

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:28.560
That's how you calm down a horse.

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:33.050
But why didn't Hibiki-san get a Super Cyalume Coord?

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:35.170
Her performance was amazing.

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:37.980
I guess Jululu thinks she's incom-pri-te.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:41.420
As in she has some fault or shortcoming?

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:44.320
I guess it's that bad personality of hers.

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:46.760
Her supercilious manner wins her no favours, either.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.320
Hibiki-san, relax!

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:55.480
I feel sorry for the cups you always break.

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:58.020
You really hold a grudge-pri.

00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:00.730
Your short temper...

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:04.030
All of you, quit my dressing room immediately!

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:05.520
Say, Hibiki-san...

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:08.330
What if you got to know Jululu better?

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:09.310
What now?

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:13.720
I'm sure Jululu just doesn't know your good points yet.

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:14.890
"Good points"?

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:24.720
It <i>does</i> seem that your chances of getting a Super Cyalume Coord soar after spending time with–

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:28.660
I spend some time all alone in a room together with her!

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:31.870
Hey, how about if you got in the Rosette...

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:32.820
Absolutely not.

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:38.340
Jululu-chan says she wants to play with Maho-chan too!

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:42.020
Hmph. I'm not going to debase myself trying to curry favour with an infant.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.720
But you want to enter the Divine Idol Grand Prix, right?

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:47.060
True.

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:53.170
But to say obtaining a Super Cyalume Coord is impossible without catering to the whims of this child...

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:56.370
I refuse to believe such a defective system exists.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:56.880
<i>Go</i>, <i>go</i>!

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:58.970
I will attain my Super Cyalume Coord through my own aesthetics.

00:07:58.970 --> 00:07:59.970
We can't!

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:00.780
But...

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:02.640
There's no other option-pri!

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:04.460
Are you listening?

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:12.170
take good care
of Jululu

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:23.700
Mama! Mama!

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:26.820
Honestly, those meddling brats...

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:29.980
Hibiki-sama, she is yours to care care of.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:31.110
I'm leaving you in charge.

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:35.800
It appears she is thirsty.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:38.130
I don't need every insignificant detail.

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:38.660
As you wish.

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:47.000
<i>I shouldn't. If I do, Hibiki-sama
won't be looking after her at all...</i>

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:51.710
The Knight of Persailles 2

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.840
Andou
Don't look for me

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.410
Andou, you turncoat!

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:10.190
Like... this?

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:17.380
<i>Now</i> what do you want?

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:18.610
Please burp her.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:19.850
"Burp"?

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:35.870
Does that taste good?

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:40.060
I can't imagine it has much nutritional value.

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:10.280
Mama...

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:12.940
My word.

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:18.030
Tears do not become you.

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:19.470
Now smile for me.

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.450
It appears you didn't hear me.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:26.140
Now smile for me.

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:33.070
What is wrong with you?

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:34.850
Explain your grievances.

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:44.110
An exhibit at the PriPara Museum.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.660
A golden dummy?

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:52.330
"A golden dummy used by Priopatra, said to be the first Divine Idol.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:57.800
A legend states that any baby who sucks it will stop crying without fail."

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:01.280
What an implausibly useful item.

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.970
This is the PriPara Museum Managerial Branch.

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:08.930
I want to purchase the golden dummy you're exhibiting.

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:11.350
Our exhibits are not for sale.

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:13.400
Price is not an object.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.610
I can prepare a nine or ten-figure sum in cash!

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:16.730
Not permissible.

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:18.490
It's the system!

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:25.730
That decides it, then.
It's time to take up the mantle once more.

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:39.580
I've prepared this scene for you.

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:41.130
I'll have you cooperate.

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:48.270
Wee-woo wee-woo!

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:52.410
We've received an advance notice from Phantom Thief Genius.

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:54.660
"Today at three pm...

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:57.900
I shall steal the prized golden dummy from the PriPara Museum."

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:01.210
What does Maho-chan think she's playing at?

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:03.410
Things are getting exciting and stuff again!

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:05.850
PriPara Police...

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:10.910
It's been a while since you were called into action, but we need you to protect the peace of all idols.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:12.210
Wee-woo!

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:17.080
Okay! PriPara Police, roll out!

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:18.500
Yeah!

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:20.610
You're under arrest!

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:25.030
PriPara Police!

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:32.100
The phantom thief's slipped away again!

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:35.930
I'll get you next time, I swear!

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:39.970
Cyalume Change!

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:46.570
Yay!

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:47.390
Geru!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.240
Onward!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.550
PriPara Museum

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:30.890
I wonder how Jululu's doing...

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:34.130
Here she comes!

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:38.190
When the wings which soar in the sky are spread...

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:40.150
You're under arrest!

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:43.400
A sole lilium casa blanca shall bloom in the darkness!

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:48.060
My name is Phantom Thief Genius!

00:14:48.060 --> 00:14:48.700
And she...

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:52.300
What? Jululu?

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:56.480
Hey! Jululu!

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:58.930
You're not allowed to be a thief's accomplice!

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:01.820
I raised you better than that, young lady!

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:22.940
So this is Priopatra's golden dummy...

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:26.080
A gift to you.

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:34.530
What cheek!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:40.370
That's a legendary relic!
Even <i>your</i> selfishness must have a limit!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.880
I demand to see your parents!

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:44.010
Jululu!

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:45.140
You're under arrest!

00:15:45.140 --> 00:15:46.460
You can't run anymore!

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:48.930
Do as you please.

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:50.840
This is now worthless to me: take it!

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.250
And... catch!

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:55.390
Aw, gross, it's all gooey!

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:57.060
Are you all okay-pri?

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:59.100
We heard from Meganii and we're here to lend our blades!

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:02.320
Hibiki-san! Why are you dressed as the phantom?

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:04.810
Don't use my real name when I'm in this guise.

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:12.490
She says it was dusty and tasted really bad.

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:14.300
But why would it...

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.410
Say, isn't this a ring?

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:19.620
A... ring?

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:21.040
Let's see...

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:24.980
"When it was first discovered,
it was assumed to be a dummy...

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:30.000
"but it was recently discovered to be a ring." It says it's a golden ring.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:30.720
What?

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:33.090
So what Hibiki-san stole was...

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:35.810
Fare thee well!

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:41.360
C'mon, Maho-chan, you're running away just 'cause you got it wrong?

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:46.310
Jululu says she wants to play with Maho-chan more.

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:49.070
Was it run, riding on the horsey?

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:52.360
I wonder if they've become closer.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.510
Can't say it looks that way-pri.

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:58.410
Jululu, you shouldn't burgle.
You'll get a spanking if you do it again.

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:08.860
Ah, the malaise that comes of not sitting on the throne.

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:10.860
Maho-chan...

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:13.400
Falulu.

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:14.600
Hm?

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:19.130
Shall we perform that duo they love in PriParis?

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:21.280
Okay!

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:24.260
Ooh, I look forward to seeing it as well.

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:25.150
What's this?

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:26.330
What song are you doing?

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:31.770
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:35.700
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.410
Starting the Coord Change.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:42.650
A coord reminiscent of your first ever performance!

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:45.320
The voluminous folds give the air of a princess!

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:47.420
Angelic Fancy Coord!

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:55.530
The austere style and noble roses make a captivating combination!

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:57.050
A bewitching coord!

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.890
Vampire Rose Coord!

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:04.890
Hibiki-sama, you're as stunning as ever!

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.060
I want to become a casablanca!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:11.860
Lady Falulu!

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:14.420
Hibiki-san and Falulu...

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:16.320
are performing together?

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:57.230
Believe...

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:04.510
in dreams.

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:12.060
Frozen Castle...

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:21.720
Mirage!

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.950
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:10.200
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:14.930
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:18.770
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:40.960
The closet's doors open for you...

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.700
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:57.490
Falulu alone?

00:21:57.490 --> 00:22:00.700
I've been snubbed again?

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:02.690
I'm sorry, Maho-chan!

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:03.980
Curse you!

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:07.090
How much must you insult me before you're satisfied?

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:08.340
I'm lost patience with this farce!

00:22:08.980 --> 00:22:10.040
I'm returning to PriParis!

00:22:10.750 --> 00:22:11.560
Maho-chan!

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:13.250
Hibiki-san!

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:16.260
Well, jeez. She might just wind up leaving this time.

00:23:52.050 --> 00:23:53.700
It's almost autumn, huh?

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:55.170
When you think of autumn...

00:23:55.170 --> 00:23:57.120
Your mind turns to Making Dramas.

00:23:57.120 --> 00:24:00.110
We'll aim for ever greater heights in order to become Divine Idols!

00:24:00.110 --> 00:24:01.080
Capisce!

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:04.460
But I swear there's something else autumn makes you think of...

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:07.180
It's the season of sports, literature, fine cuisine.

00:24:07.180 --> 00:24:08.370
There are a fair few.

00:24:08.370 --> 00:24:11.230
No, that's not it. "When you think of autumn"...

00:24:11.230 --> 00:24:12.600
Oh, I know!

00:24:12.600 --> 00:24:13.550
Ooh, what is it?

00:24:14.570 --> 00:24:16.850
Next time, <i>Love at First Steps</i>!

00:24:16.850 --> 00:24:19.890
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
